- Introducing Weighted Reservoir Sampling (WRS) to foveated rasterization to temporally accumulate high-quality pixel samples;
- Proposing a new temporal bias function based on Bernoulli Trials to reweight reservoir samples without dependence
- on absolute or relative time that samples were selected for inclusion in the reservoir;
- Validation of our approach via user studies to improve foveated text reading speed, and improved image quality over foveated rendering and foveated rendering with Temporal Antialiasing (TAA).
